    "answer": {
      "short": "$(x-y)(x+y+4)$\n\nUse the difference of squares, then factor out $x-y$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^2-y^2+4x-4y&=(x-y)(x+y)+4(x-y)\\\\x^2-y^2+4x-4y&=(x-y)(x+y+4)\\end{align*}$$",
